type: software
title: "Bazaar Markets: The Agentic Ad Engine"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic market simulator for studying deception, verification and brand value, built as an evaluation
  environment for AI agents. Version 1.0.0 is the frozen rule-based baseline: engine, reference market, regression
  digests and every rule-based result so far (runs/BASELINE_1_0_0.md).
